,"beta":0.54,"beta_5y":0.54,"kd":4.5,"tax":21,"growth_10y":[5.4,4.9,4.4,4,3.8,3.5,3.2,2.9,2.6,2.2],"g1":5.4,"g2":3.5,"g":2.25,"wacc":6.35,"ev":18960,"fmp_official_ev":18960,"dcf_model_ev":123900,"ev_to_ebitda":6.7,"debt_to_ebitda":1.74,"net_debt_to_ebitda":1.5,"f_score":6,"f_score_breakdown":[{"id":1,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"資產回報率 ROA > 0","passed":1,"detail":"當期 ROA = 4.8%"},{"id":2,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"營業現金流 CFO > 0","passed":1,"detail":"自由現金流 = $4,381M"},{"id":3,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"資產回報率持續擴張 (ΔROA > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"回報率穩步領先同業基準"},{"id":4,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"應計利潤品質高 (CFO > 淨利潤)","passed":1,"detail":"真實現金流充沛，無虛報帳面獲利"},{"id":5,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"財務槓桿未惡化 (ΔLeverage ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"總負債資產比率 = 40.4%"},{"id":6,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"短期流動性安全 (ΔLiquidity > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"流動比率 = 1.01"},{"id":7,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"股本未遭稀釋 (ΔShares ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"未大幅增發新股割韭菜"},{"id":8,"category":"營運效率","desc":"毛利率擴張 (ΔMargin > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":432.69,"default_fair_val":432.69,"premium_pct":-83.8,"is_undervalued":true,"pe_trailing":21,"pe_forward":18.5,"pb_trailing":1.7,"pb_forward":1.5,"div_yield":1.65,"ps_ratio":1.1,"fcf_to_ev":3.54,"fcf_to_mcap":22.63,"liab_to_assets":40.4,"cash_to_assets":3.6,"current_ratio":1.01,"roe":8,"roa":4.8,"moat":{"ticker":"OVV","period":"2026Q2","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":3,"comment_zh":"能源產業的商品屬性極強，OVV 作為油氣勘探與生產商，其產品（原油、天然氣）本質上是同質化的，缺乏顯著的品牌溢價或定價權。公司營收與利潤高度依賴國際原物料價格波動，而非自身品牌或產品差異化能力。在產業週期低谷時，定價能力更是微乎其微，難以轉嫁成本或維持高利潤率。因此，此維度得分極低。","comment_en":"The energy sector is inherently commoditized. Ovintiv, as an oil and gas exploration and production company, deals in largely undifferentiated products (crude oil, natural gas). It lacks significant brand premium or pricing power. Revenue and profits are highly susceptible to global commodity price fluctuations, rather than its own brand or product differentiation. Pricing power is minimal during industry downturns, making cost pass-through or sustained high margins difficult. Therefore, the score is very low."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":4,"comment_zh":"油氣行業的進入壁壘主要來自於勘探許可、開採權證以及嚴格的環保法規。OVV 透過持續的勘探、併購以及對特定區域（如加拿大和美國的非常規油氣資源）的深耕，獲得了營運所需的許可和資源。然而，這些並非獨特的專利或特許權，而是行業普遍存在的准入條件。技術創新雖有助於提高效率，但難以形成持久的、排他性的競爭優勢。","comment_en":"Barriers in the oil and gas industry stem primarily from exploration licenses, extraction rights, and stringent environmental regulations. Ovintiv secures necessary permits and resources through continuous exploration, acquisitions, and deep operational experience in specific regions (like Canadian and US unconventional resources). However, these are standard industry entry requirements, not unique patents or exclusive franchises. While technological innovation aids efficiency, it rarely creates a lasting, exclusive competitive advantage."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":2,"comment_zh":"OVV 的客戶主要是煉油廠、工業用戶及其他能源交易商。這些客戶在選擇供應商時，主要考量的是價格、供應穩定性和產品規格，而非與特定供應商建立長期、難以轉換的合作關係。雖然供應鏈的穩定性有一定價值，但客戶總能找到替代供應源，轉換成本相對較低。因此，此維度壁壘非常薄弱。","comment_en":"Ovintiv's customers are primarily refineries, industrial users, and energy traders. Their supplier selection is driven by price, supply reliability, and product specifications, rather than establishing long-term, difficult-to-switch relationships. While supply chain stability has some value, customers can generally find alternative sources, making switching costs relatively low. This moat dimension is therefore very weak."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":1,"comment_zh":"油氣勘探與生產業務本質上不具備網絡效應。OVV 的產品直接銷售給下游買家，其價值不隨用戶數量的增加而提升。公司與供應商、客戶之間的關係更多是基於交易而非網絡互動。沒有任何機制能讓更多用戶加入 OVV 的服務或產品，從而增強其價值。此維度幾乎不存在護城河。","comment_en":"The oil and gas exploration and production business inherently lacks network effects. Ovintiv's products are sold directly to downstream buyers, and their value does not increase with the number of users. Relationships with suppliers and customers are transactional rather than network-driven. There is no mechanism that makes joining Ovintiv's services or using its products more valuable as more people do so. This moat dimension is virtually non-existent."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"OVV 在北美地區擁有大規模、低成本的非常規油氣資產組合，尤其在蒙特婁（Montney）和二疊紀盆地（Permian Basin）等地。龐大的營運規模帶來了顯著的成本優勢，包括鑽井、完井和生產效率的提升，以及在基礎設施和物流上的規模經濟。這使得 OVV 在行業週期低谷時，仍能保持相對較低的生產成本，並在價格上保持競爭力。","comment_en":"Ovintiv possesses a large-scale, low-cost portfolio of unconventional oil and gas assets in North America, particularly in regions like the Montney and Permian Basin. Its vast operational scale provides significant cost advantages, including enhanced drilling, completion, and production efficiencies, as well as economies of scale in infrastructure and logistics. This allows Ovintiv to maintain relatively low production costs and competitive pricing, even during industry downturns."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"OVV 在加拿大卑詩省和阿爾伯塔省的蒙特婁（Montney）地區擁有世界級的、低成本的天然氣儲量，以及在美國二疊紀盆地的優質輕質原油資產。這些特定地理區域的優質儲量和成熟的開採技術，構成了其獨特的資產壁壘。相較於其他地區或技術，這些資產的開採成本和生產效率具有明顯優勢，使其在行業內佔據有利地位。","comment_en":"Ovintiv holds world-class, low-cost natural gas reserves in the Montney region of British Columbia and Alberta, Canada, along with premium light oil assets in the US Permian Basin. The high quality of these reserves in specific geographic areas, combined with established extraction technologies, forms a unique asset-based barrier. These assets offer distinct advantages in extraction costs and production efficiency compared to other regions or technologies, positioning the company favorably within the industry."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"OVV 在非常規油氣開採方面展現了卓越的營運效率。透過持續的技術優化、鑽井平台效率提升以及精準的成本控制，公司能夠在較低的商品價格環境下維持健康的自由現金流。其在蒙特婁地區的低成本生產能力，以及對生產流程的精細管理，都體現了其營運上的競爭優勢，使其能夠在行業週期中更具韌性。","comment_en":"Ovintiv demonstrates exceptional operational efficiency in unconventional oil and gas extraction. Through continuous technological optimization, improved drilling rig productivity, and precise cost management, the company can sustain healthy free cash flow even in lower commodity price environments. Its low-cost production capabilities in the Montney region and meticulous management of production processes highlight its operational competitive advantage, enhancing resilience through industry cycles."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"OVV 近年來展現了穩健且明智的資本配置策略。公司專注於償還債務、向股東返還資本（股息和股票回購），並進行有選擇性的資本支出以維持和優化生產。其自由現金流生成能力強勁，並能有效將現金回饋給股東，同時保持健康的資產負債表。這種將資本導向股東回報和維持長期價值的做法，是其重要的護城河。","comment_en":"Ovintiv has demonstrated a robust and prudent capital allocation strategy in recent years. The company prioritizes debt repayment, returning capital to shareholders through dividends and share buybacks, and making selective capital expenditures to maintain and optimize production. Its strong free cash flow generation is effectively channeled back to shareholders while maintaining a healthy balance sheet. This focus on directing capital towards shareholder returns and long-term value preservation constitutes a significant moat."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":2,"comment_zh":"如 M3 所述，OVV 的客戶基礎主要是大宗商品買家，他們對價格和供應穩定性敏感，但轉換成本低。雖然 OVV 努力維持長期客戶關係，但其產品的商品化性質意味著客戶總有替代選擇。因此，客戶忠誠度並非其核心競爭優勢，難以形成持久的客戶留存壁壘。","comment_en":"As noted in M3, Ovintiv's customer base consists mainly of commodity buyers sensitive to price and supply stability, with low switching costs. While Ovintiv strives to maintain long-term customer relationships, the commoditized nature of its products means customers always have alternatives. Consequently, customer loyalty is not a core competitive advantage, and it's difficult to establish a durable customer retention moat."},"m10_durability":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"OVV 的業務模式高度依賴於全球能源價格，這使其面臨週期性波動的風險。然而，其在北美擁有高品質、低成本的非常規油氣資產，以及卓越的營運效率和審慎的資本配置，為其提供了較強的韌性。這些因素使其能夠在行業低迷時期生存並保持盈利，但其長期耐久性仍受制於能源市場的不可預測性。","comment_en":"Ovintiv's business model is highly dependent on global energy prices, exposing it to cyclical volatility. However, its high-quality, low-cost unconventional assets in North America, coupled with excellent operational efficiency and prudent capital allocation, provide considerable resilience. These factors enable survival and profitability during industry downturns, but its long-term durability remains constrained by the inherent unpredictability of the energy market."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"OVV 的護城河主要體現在其擁有北美地區（特別是蒙特婁和二疊紀盆地）的世界級低成本油氣資產（M6），以及由此衍生的規模經濟和營運效率（M5, M7）。公司近年來展現了良好的資本配置能力，專注於股東回報和維持穩健財務（M8）。然而，其業務本質為商品型，缺乏品牌定價權（M1）、網絡效應（M4）和客戶轉換成本（M3, M9），使其護城河相對有限且易受大宗商品價格波動影響。整體而言，OVV 屬於典型的資源型公司，其競爭優勢更多來自於優質的資產和高效的運營，而非難以複製的特許經營權或網絡效應。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"Ovintiv's moat primarily stems from its world-class, low-cost oil and gas assets in North America, particularly in the Montney and Permian Basin (M6), leading to economies of scale and operational efficiencies (M5, M7). The company has shown strong capital allocation discipline, focusing on shareholder returns and financial stability (M8). However, its commodity-based business lacks brand pricing power (M1), network effects (M4), and significant customer switching costs (M3, M9), limiting its moat's breadth and making it susceptible to energy price volatility. Overall, Ovintiv is a resource-based company whose competitive advantages lie in its quality assets and efficient operations, rather than exclusive franchises or network effects.","evidenceHash":"020af4517f6e5c996b0b45986e832a3d35e393ac347f924e0e15413b79a0944c","assessmentPolicy":"us-buffett-moat-v3"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null},"fScore":{"score":6,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"grey","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-27T16:12:46.364Z","evidenceHash":"34df5f8803a8ea077d6a260367904f07900d576c21cfe22ce2d8f2a64df79212"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"clean","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-27T16:12:46.364Z","evidenceHash":"34df5f8803a8ea077d6a260367904f07900d576c21cfe22ce2d8f2a64df79212"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/OVV.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/OVV.png","website":"https://www.ovintiv.com","ceo":"Brendan Michael McCracken","full_time_employees":"1465","description":"Ovintiv Inc. is an energy company primarily focused on the exploration, production, and sale of natural gas, crude oil, and natural gas liquids (NGLs). Its activities are managed across three main segments: operations within the United States, operations in Canada, and market optimization efforts. The company holds significant resource plays, notably in the Permian Basin of West Texas, the Anadarko Basin in west-central Oklahoma, and the Montney region spanning northeastern British Columbia and northwestern Alberta. Additional upstream holdings include the Bakken formation in North Dakota, the Uinta Basin in central Utah, the Horn River Basin in northeastern British Columbia, and Wheatland in southern Alberta. Ovintiv Inc. was formed in 2020, the same year it adopted its current name, having previously been known as Encana Corporation. Its corporate headquarters are located in Denver, Colorado.","description_en":"Ovintiv Inc. is an energy company primarily focused on the exploration, production, and sale of natural gas, crude oil, and natural gas liquids (NGLs). Its activities are managed across three main segments: operations within the United States, operations in Canada, and market optimization efforts. The company holds significant resource plays, notably in the Permian Basin of West Texas, the Anadarko Basin in west-central Oklahoma, and the Montney region spanning northeastern British Columbia and northwestern Alberta. Additional upstream holdings include the Bakken formation in North Dakota, the Uinta Basin in central Utah, the Horn River Basin in northeastern British Columbia, and Wheatland in southern Alberta. Ovintiv Inc. was formed in 2020, the same year it adopted its current name, having previously been known as Encana Corporation. Its corporate headquarters are located in Denver, Colorado.","description_zh":"**Ovintiv Inc. (OVV) 業務營運分析**\n\nOvintiv Inc. 是一家專注於天然氣、原油及天然氣凝析液 (NGLs) 探勘、生產與銷售的能源公司。其營運主要劃分為三大區塊：美國境內業務、加拿大境內業務，以及市場優化。\n\n公司掌握多處關鍵的油氣資源區，包括德州西部的二疊紀盆地 (Permian Basin)、奧克拉荷馬州中西部的安那達科盆地 (Anadarko Basin)，以及橫跨卑詩省東北部與亞伯達省西北部的蒙特尼 (Montney) 區域。此外，其上游資產還涵蓋北達科他州的巴肯頁岩 (Bakken formation)、猶他州中部的尤因塔盆地 (Uinta Basin)、卑詩省東北部的霍恩河盆地 (Horn River Basin)，以及亞伯達省南部的惠特蘭 (Wheatland)。\n\nOvintiv 於 2020 年成立並更名，前身為 Encana Corporation，總部位於科羅拉多州丹佛市。公司透過整合上游探勘生產與下游市場銷售，致力於高效能的資源開發與價值實現。","address":"370 17th Street","city":"Denver","state":"CO","zip":"80202","country":"US","phone":"303 623 2300","full_address":"370 17th Street, Denver, CO 80202, US","range_52w":"35.47-70.98","year_high":70.98,"year_low":35.47,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":35.47,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2026-10-01","name":"Shaw Brian Gordon","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":190,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-10-01","name":"Chhina Sippy","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":16,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-10-01","name":"IZZO RALPH","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":39,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-10-01","name":"Gentle Meg","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":62,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-10-01","name":"Mayson Howard John","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":50,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-10-01","name":"King Terri Gay","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":4,"price":0,"total_val